# Email Settings (invite/credentials emails)
# IMPORTANT for deliverability (avoid Gmail spam): use a transactional email provider
# (Resend, SendGrid, Mailgun, Postmark, Amazon SES) with a VERIFIED sending domain for wangari.site.
# 1) Add/verify your domain in the provider and publish the SPF, DKIM, and DMARC DNS records they give you.
# 2) Set EMAIL_HOST/PORT/USER/PASSWORD from the provider SMTP settings.
# 3) Set DEFAULT_FROM_EMAIL to an address on that verified domain (e.g. invites@wangari.site).
# 4) Keep EMAIL_USE_TLS=True and EMAIL_USE_SSL=False for port 587 (or adjust per provider).
# 5) Update the same env vars in Vercel/production and redeploy.
# Temporary fallback: Gmail SMTP works for some inboxes but often lands in spam or is rejected by Gmail recipients.
